The current engine uses frame-dependent simulation, category-ordered bullet hits, and procedural safety boosts. I’m keeping the Tactics mechanics while adding campaign generation, deterministic stepping, and enemy registration. I’ll also expose profiling counters for the orchestrator; Chromium draw-call measurements aren’t available in this sandbox.

